[[127,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Disconnect the rod (1a) from the retainer (1b), then from the retainer (1c) for the interior handle.</p><p>2. Keep the interior handle assembly.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/939000631.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[127,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Check that the interior handle is not damaged.</p><p>- Connect the rod to the interior handle retainers.</p>"]]